## What the official site says

[Rockstar’s GTA VI page](https://www.rockstargames.com/VI), rechecked on 18 November 2026 (UTC), still says the game is **Coming November 19, 2026** for PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S. The page still shows **Pre-Load Now**. It does not say Available Now, Out Now, or Play Now. The page still labels PlayStation 5 as the platform it plays best on. That page does not list a PC date.

Treat November 19 as Rockstar’s stated target, not a promise that the date cannot move. If Rockstar changes the status wording after launch unlocks begin, that change belongs on Rockstar’s page first.

This is a separate game from Grand Theft Auto V Enhanced, which is already released on PC. The Enhanced edition has its own [Steam listing](/apps/gta-v-enhanced).

## Who can pre-load now

Pre-loading is no longer a future November 10 start. Rockstar’s [Pre-Load Grand Theft Auto VI Now](https://www.rockstargames.com/newswire/article/89834o94713o21/pre-load-grand-theft-auto-vi-now) post, dated 10 November 2026 and still linked from the GTA VI page on 18 November 2026, covers the open pre-load window. PlayStation’s matching post, rechecked the same day, says pre-loading is available at PlayStation Store, and that players who purchased the code-in-box version can activate the code as soon as they get it to begin pre-loading.

| Platform | What the official sources say |
| --- | --- |
| PlayStation 5 | [PlayStation’s 10 November 2026 post](https://blog.playstation.com/2026/11/10/pre-load-grand-theft-auto-vi-on-ps5-starting-today/), rechecked 18 November 2026, says pre-loading is available at PlayStation Store. It also says code-in-box buyers can activate the code as soon as they get it. |
| Xbox Series X\|S | Rockstar lists Xbox Series X\|S beside PlayStation 5 on the GTA VI page. [Xbox Wire’s 10 November 2026 post](https://news.xbox.com/en-us/2026/11/10/grand-theft-auto-6-comes-to-xbox-cloud-gaming-november-19/), rechecked 18 November 2026, says Xbox Series X and Xbox Series S can play natively and are available now to pre-install. |
| Xbox One | Not listed as a native Rockstar platform on the GTA VI page. Xbox Wire says Grand Theft Auto VI is playable on day one through Xbox Cloud Gaming on Xbox One and Xbox Series X\|S, starting at 1am ET on November 19, using Xbox Series S graphics settings when cloud-streamed. |
| PC | Rockstar’s GTA VI page still does not list a PC release. There is no PC pre-load to start from that page. |

Rockstar’s earlier [Pre-Load Begins on November 10](https://www.rockstargames.com/newswire/article/k4ak9okk485712) headline marked the start of that window. Use the newer **Pre-Load Now** post and your console store for the current download button.

## How release timing works

Rockstar’s page, rechecked 18 November 2026 (UTC), keeps **Coming November 19, 2026** as the launch-day label for PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S. It still has not flipped to an Available Now / Out Now status on that page.

PlayStation’s 10 November 2026 post, rechecked 18 November 2026, says launch unlocks on a rolling midnight by country, beginning at 12:00 a.m. NZDT in New Zealand on November 19 and continuing as other countries reach midnight. Pre-loading installs the game files early. It does not unlock play before that launch window.

Xbox Wire, rechecked 18 November 2026, says the game launches November 19, that cloud streaming for Grand Theft Auto VI begins at 1am ET on November 19, and that players in supported markets can buy cloud playtime to stream supported games without a Game Pass subscription (starting November 11 per that post). Cloud gaming availability and related options may vary by market and device; the post says Grand Theft Auto VI must be purchased separately.

Rockstar publishes a [platforms and editions support article](https://support.rockstargames.com/articles/4QfG4FmZCf5W1gS8jy4UVT/grand-theft-auto-vi-platform-editions-and-versions). A fresh fetch of that support page timed out during this check, so use Rockstar’s page directly for the current wording on physical editions and retail codes. Retail shipping and pickup timing can vary by store.

## What this page does not claim

This page does not claim the game is already Available Now on Rockstar’s site. As of this check, Rockstar still shows Coming November 19, 2026 and Pre-Load Now.

This page does not quote a required download size. Rockstar’s current GTA VI page and the Pre-Load Now post checked here do not state a gigabyte figure, so none is invented.

This is a dated editorial snapshot. It is not a hands-on preview, a PC release date, or a performance comparison. GameNews is not affiliated with Rockstar. When a newer official post appears, use the publisher’s page rather than an older recap.
